  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health System Strengthening Project -Establishment of El-Maarouf Hospital</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s developmental objective is to support the government&apos;s efforts in achieving health-related Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), specifically enhancing access to quality essential healthcare services and safe, effective, quality, and affordable essential medicines and vaccines for all. The project aims to improve access to and quality of specialized healthcare services through establishing a hospital, increasing availability and equitable access to emergency healthcare services, and enhancing pandemic response, including COVID-19 in Comoros.</narrative>
  </description>
